    "Füge die Anlagen hinzu, auf denen du schiesst.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add the ranges where you shoot."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoutez les stands où vous tirez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aggiungi i poligoni dove spari."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Füllt deine Liste der Schiessanlagen mit allen Schweizer Anlagen vor, mit Ort, Höhe, Distanzen und Schussrichtung (Daten: swisstopo). Geht auch später unter Einstellungen › Schiessanlagen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prefills your list of ranges with all Swiss shooting ranges, with location, altitude, distances and shooting direction (data: swisstopo). You can also do this later under Settings › Ranges."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pré-remplit ta liste avec tous les stands de tir suisses, avec lieu, altitude, distances et direction de tir (données : swisstopo). Possible aussi plus tard sous Réglages › Stands de tir."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Precompila la tua lista con tutti i poligoni di tiro svizzeri, con luogo, altitudine, distanze e direzione di tiro (dati: swisstopo). Possibile anche più tardi in Impostazioni › Poligoni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für Sportschützen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For sport shooters"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour tireurs sportifs"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per tiratori sportivi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für Stiche, die an diesem Anlass mehrmals geschossen wurden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For matches shot more than once at this event."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour les cibles tirées plusieurs fois à cet événement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per i bersagli tirati più volte a questo evento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für die Wetterdaten von Apple Weather schickt die App die Koordinaten der Schiessanlage und den Zeitpunkt an Apple, nicht deinen Standort. Weil du meist dort schiesst, ist es aber fast derselbe Ort.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the weather from Apple Weather, the app sends the range's coordinates and the time to Apple, not your location. As you usually shoot there, it is nearly the same place though."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour la météo d'Apple, l'app envoie à Apple les coordonnées du stand et l'heure, pas ta position. Comme tu y tires le plus souvent, c'est tout de même presque le même endroit."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per il meteo di Apple, l'app invia ad Apple le coordinate del poligono e l'ora, non la tua posizione. Siccome di solito tiri lì, è però quasi lo stesso posto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Für ein weiteres Programm am selben Anlass, auch mit einem anderen Sportgerät.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For another programme at the same event, also with different equipment."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour un autre programme au même événement, aussi avec un autre équipement."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Per un altro programma allo stesso evento, anche con un altro attrezzo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
